000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
000300* Computes gross pay for a list of employees
000400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000500 DATA DIVISION.
000600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000700 01  WS-EMPLOYEE.
000800     05  WS-NAME         PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
000900     05  WS-HOURS        PIC 9(3)V9 VALUE ZERO.
001000     05  WS-RATE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 12.50.
001100     05  WS-GROSS        PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3.
001200 01  WS-COUNT            PIC 99 VALUE 0.
001300 01  WS-EOF              PIC X VALUE 'N'.
001400     88  END-OF-FILE     VALUE 'Y'.
001500 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001600 MAIN-PARA.
001700     PERFORM INIT-PARA
001800     PERFORM CALC-PARA UNTIL END-OF-FILE
001900     DISPLAY "Processed " WS-COUNT " employees"
002000     STOP RUN.
002100
002200 INIT-PARA.
002300     MOVE "JANE DOE" TO WS-NAME
002400     MOVE 40 TO WS-HOURS.
002500
002600 CALC-PARA.
002700     COMPUTE WS-GROSS = WS-HOURS * WS-RATE
002800     IF WS-GROSS > 1000
002900         DISPLAY "High earner: " WS-NAME
003000     ELSE
003100         DISPLAY "Regular: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NAME)
003200     END-IF
003300     ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
003400     MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF. *> inline comment
